    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"To assist in the review of the \"Public Review Draft -- Digital Cartographic Standard for Geologic Map Symbolization,\" a PostScript implementation of the proposed standard has been prepared. The symbols are contained in Encapsulated PostScript (EPS) files that are included on this CD-ROM.\r\n\r\nThis PostScript implementation will enable reviewers to apply directly the proposed standard to geologic maps or illustrations prepared in desktop illustration and (or) publishing software. \r\n\r\nTo review this proposed standard, please use the files on this CD-ROM. Your comments and suggestions will be used to improve the draft standard. Instructions for review can be found at the Geologic Data Subcommittee's Web site (http://ncgmp.usgs.gov/fgdc_gds/mapsymb/).\"",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
